BorrowTest
├── given market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given market is frozen
│   └── it should revert
├── given both assets and shares are provided
│   └── it should revert
├── given receiver is zero address
│   └── it should revert
├── given sender is not authorized for onBehalf
│   └── it should revert
├── given assets is provided
│   ├── when assets is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when assets is greater than zero
│       ├── when market has insufficient liquidity
│       │   └── it should revert
│       ├── when user has insufficient collateral
│       │   └── it should revert
│       └── when user has sufficient collateral
│           ├── when borrow opening fee is zero
│           │   └── it should borrow and mint shares
│           └── when borrow opening fee is greater than zero
│               └── it should borrow, mint shares and apply fee
└── given shares is provided
    ├── when shares is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when shares is greater than zero
        ├── when market has insufficient liquidity
        │   └── it should revert
        ├── when user has insufficient collateral
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when user has sufficient collateral
            ├── when borrow opening fee is zero
            │   └── it should borrow and mint shares
            └── when borrow opening fee is greater than zero
                └── it should borrow, mint shares and apply fee 